hapter-shiji-015","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-015","source_revision":"2607002","kind":"table_person_mention","quote_ref":"cell"}],"date_normalizations":[{"era":"BCE","era_year":260,"year":-259,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"四十七年，秦使左庶長王龁攻韓，取上黨。上黨民走趙。趙軍長平，以按據上黨民。四月，龁因攻趙。趙使廉頗將。趙軍士卒犯秦斥兵，秦斥兵斬趙裨將茄。六月，陷趙軍，取二鄣四尉。七月，趙軍筑壘壁而守之。秦又攻其壘，取二尉，敗其陣，奪西壘壁。廉頗堅壁以待秦，秦數挑戰，趙兵不出。趙王數以為讓。而秦相應侯又使人行千金於趙為反閒，曰：「秦之所惡，獨畏馬服子趙括將耳，廉頗易與，且降矣。」趙王既怒廉頗軍多失亡，軍數敗，又反堅壁不敢戰，而又聞秦反閒之言，因使趙括代廉頗將以擊秦。秦聞馬服子將，乃陰使武安君白起為上將軍。而王龁為尉裨將，令軍中有敢泄武安君將者斬。趙括至，則出兵擊秦軍。秦軍詳敗而走，張二奇兵以劫之。趙軍逐勝，追造秦壁。壁堅拒不得入，而秦奇兵二萬五千人絕趙軍後，又一軍五千騎絕趙壁閒，趙軍分而為二，糧道絕。而秦出輕兵擊之。趙戰不利，因筑壁堅守，以待救至。秦王聞趙食道絕，王自之河內，賜民爵各一級，發年十五以上悉詣長平，遮絕趙救及糧食。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang","source_id":"s-shiji-073-baiwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p004","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m004-0165","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/073.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang","source_id":"s-shiji-073-baiwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p005","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m005-0045","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/073.json"}],"references":[{"title":"〈六國年表〉秦紀年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷015&oldid=2607002","quote":"四十七。白起破趙長平，殺卒四十五萬。","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r217-c02"},{"title":"〈六國年表〉數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷015&oldid=2607002","quote":"260","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r217-c00"}],"rationale":"四十七年長平戰事連續第五段至九月趙括戰死，按原年號與年表四十七年及數位年欄暫定前260年。年表未獨立記趙括死亡，不作同名死亡互證；月份只留原文，未核影像及曆表、不推公曆日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"record_id":"le-shiji073-002","person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","date_role":"life_event","event_type":"death"}],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-234","person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","surfaces":["趙括"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p104","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/043.json"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、太子繼位及連續政治事件；公子丹／太子丹／孝成王、觸龍／左師公、平原君／趙勝暫接。平陽君趙豹與陽文君趙豹、太后與惠文后仍分候選；長平趙括不與祖系趙括合併，筮史敢占的敢字姓名讀法未定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji073-018","person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-073-baiwang"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","rationale":"依長平敘事明示姓名、替將次序與局部回指暫接；王龁龁、趙括馬服子與白起武安君按本篇明示。應侯不補未見姓名，趙王接前段趙孝成王、秦王接開篇秦昭王，各限此敘事。反閒廉頗且降的話語及趙卒數保留來源層，不作已確證事實或跨篇調和。","surfaces":["括","趙括","馬服子","馬服子趙括"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p004","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/073.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p005","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/073.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/073.json"}]},{"id":"d-shiji079-049","person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","surfaces":["馬服","馬服子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p026","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/079.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p032","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/079.json"}],"rationale":"按全35段明示姓名與局部引語暫接，范睢張祿范叔范君應侯分說話範圍；蔡澤先生綱成君依具體敘事。越王事大夫種與句踐敘事相配，更新候選標籤保留ID。馬服／馬服子依同段長平角色暫接未補姓名，第32段白公已按四子敘事及集解釋名暫接白起，韓子未強接韓非，喬松不補神仙，范中行族稱不接范睢。王之弟、改讀前止足及引古異說各留，預言與擬議方案不當史實核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji081-020","person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-081-lianlin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["括","趙括"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p014","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/081.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p015","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/081.json"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p016","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/081.json"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名、國別君序與代將敘事暫接；李牧牧在明示北邊主題內同指，趙王遷王稱限定末次代將。北邊早年趙王、他人及單于未名分存，不強接悼襄；太史公讓頗承接廉藺敘事，其他引語指代待逐處覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji079-zhaokuo","person_ids":["ja0_1pr_vhk"],"canonical_person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai","c-shiji-081-lianlin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p026","mention_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai:m026-0023"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/079.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p032","mention_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai:m032-0883"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/079.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p014","mention_ids":["c-shiji-081-lianlin:m014-0100"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/081.json"}],"rationale":"本篇長平反間後馬服子代廉頗及北阬馬服，與廉頗藺相如列傳明示馬服君趙奢之子趙括代廉頗相配；只接這兩個戰場角色，不把所有馬服或馬服君爵稱都指趙括。 原文字句、提及錨點與各篇時間主張分存，不作全域同名替換；未核底本影像。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"identity_materialized":true},{"id":"eq-shiji081-kuo","person_ids":["ja0_1pr_vhk"],"canonical_person_id":"ja0_1pr_vhk","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao","c-shiji-081-lianlin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p104","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m104-0012","c-shiji-043-zhao:m104-0020","c-shiji-043-zhao:m104-0023"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/043.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p016","mention_ids":["c-shiji-081-lianlin:m016-0000","c-shiji-081-lianlin:m016-0058","c-shiji-081-lianlin:m016-0071","c-shiji-081-lianlin:m016-0074","c-shiji-081-lianlin:m016